        "en": "Separate quiet-start refinement of a cold 1D periodic plasma from independent-seed initial particle noise; record charge, momentum, Gauss diagnostics and energy error."
      },
      "limits": {
        "ja": "DOP853は独立PIC空間実装ではありません。電荷・運動量の保持とエネルギーの近似保存を区別し、初期雑音のNスケーリングを時間発展した熱プラズマの保証としません。Landau減衰・電磁PIC・相対論・衝突は未検証です。",
        "en": "DOP853 is not an independent PIC spatial implementation. Distinguish charge/momentum preservation from approximate energy conservation. Initial-noise N scaling does not validate evolved warm plasmas. Landau damping, electromagnetic/relativistic PIC and collisions remain unvalidated."
